# Everything is excluded by default except what's listed after the `!` lines.
# The extension bundle (dist/) is self-contained — @ordewell/core and all deps
# are bundled by tsup — so node_modules must NOT ship.
#
# vsce keeps any file matched by a `!` rule regardless of where the rule sits,
# so a trailing `**/*.map` cannot claw back what `!dist/**` already included —
# that is how a 4.2 MB sourcemap shipped in every install. The include globs
# therefore have to be narrow enough to leave maps out in the first place.
**
!dist/extension.js
!dist/webviews/**
!media/**
!skills/**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
